Clearing out Sokoban, Alanis the elven Wizard decided to pet-test a 
jade ring for curses. She forgot that a leashed pet (a cat, in her 
case) won't always move "only reluctantly" when dragged over something 
cursed. So she put on the ring, and then: "Scratch (the cat) breaks 
loose from its leash! Scratch bites! Scratch bites!" Not good with only 
43 max HP (still kinda low-level here). She tries to remove the ring: 
"You can't. It's cursed." Very bad. And no holy water or ID'd remove 
curse, either.

Searching her inventory, she notices an engrave-tested wand that made 
the writing vanish. Hoping it was cancellation, she dropped a bunch of 
things she didn't want cancelled, Scratch biting her a few more times 
in the process, and zapped it at herself. "Gee! All of a sudden, you 
can't see yourself." Peachy. One more bite from Scrath, and she was cat 
chow.

Jeez. I'll never get back to Medusa's Island at this rate. Off to 
"Lessons learned the hard way" with me.

